# 10a — the table widget.
##
# One keystroke per line, `#` for a comment, `key: label` to name the frame.
# Replayed by:  ./bin/hms --db-path=hms.db --render docs/review/10a.keys
##
# The steps are the walkthrough in 10a-table.md, in order.

4: the holdings table
ctrl+n: cursor down
ctrl+n
ctrl+n: three rows down
alt+>: jump to the end
alt+<: back to the top
ctrl+f: focus the next column
ctrl+f: focus QTY
s: sort by the focused column
s: reverse it
ctrl+space: select this row
ctrl+n
ctrl+space
ctrl+n
ctrl+space: three rows selected
esc: selection cleared
3: the items table
4: back to holdings
